            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the First Step Act does not contravene the well\u2011established sentencing practice that gives district courts broad discretion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01c2a82ed903373e126e721864e3269469120233fee779908a05b86c3ab220b2",
