              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Carlos Concepci\u00f3n was convicted in 2007 of distributing five or more grams of crack cocaine and was sentenced to 19 years (228 months) in prison."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01c2a82ed903373e126e721864e3269469120233fee779908a05b86c3ab220b2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01c2a82ed903-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court held that the First Step Act permits district courts to consider intervening changes of law or fact when reducing a sentence."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01c2a82ed903373e126e721864e3269469120233fee779908a05b86c3ab220b2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-01c2a82ed903-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court also held that the First Step Act does not override the long\u2011standing practice that district courts have broad discretion in sentencing."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
